<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Metrostav H1 net rises to CZK52.7mln.</title>
<headline>Czech Metrostav H1 net rises to CZK52.7mln.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech construction firm Metrostav a.s. first half results (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p>				   H1 1997	   H1 1996</p>
<p> PRE-TAX PROFIT		 73.432	    58.451</p>
<p> AFTER-TAX PROFIT	     52.738	    43.248</p>
<p> OPERATING PROFIT	     64.994	    50.484</p>
<p> WRITE OFFS		     55.574	    56.719</p>
<p>REVENUES FOR OWN</p>
<p> GOODS AND SERVICES	2,205.838	 1,836.214</p>
<p> PRODUCTION		  2,321.814	 2,469.907</p>
<p> BASIC CAPITAL		 775.667	   508.889</p>
<p> ASSETS			3,388.192	 3,146.921</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
